{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51483","headline":"送李商隐侍御奉使入关 · 李郢","name":"送李商隐侍御奉使入关","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁园相遇管弦中，君踏仙梯我转蓬。\n《白雪》咏歌人似玉，青云头角马生风。\n相逢几日虚怀待，宾幕连期醉蝶同。\n如有扁舟棹歌思，题诗时寄五湖东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51483.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51483","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}